# Normalise line endings in the repository so builds behave identically on Linux CI
# and on Windows working copies. Upstream committed mvnw/Jenkinsfile with LF content but
# no .gitattributes, so a Windows checkout rewrites them as CRLF and `sh ./mvnw` breaks.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.jar binary
*.class binary
